# onnxruntime-node (used for local embeddings) ships CPU binaries in the package. Its
# install script otherwise tries to download optional GPU (CUDA / DirectML) runtimes
# from NuGet; when that download fails, the whole install aborts, leaving Electron
# without its binary ("Error: Electron uninstall"). betaxiv only needs the CPU build.
onnxruntime-node-install=skip
